<title>CHINA: China January-August cotton imports down.</title>
<headline>China January-August cotton imports down.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's cotton imports reached 460,000 tonnes in the first eight months, down 21.2 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Imports in August alone were 30,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>China's cotton exports in the first eight months slumped to 3,878 tonnes from 20,930 tonnes in the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports were 701 tonnes in August alone.</p>
</text>
